36:["$","ul","ul-1",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Early morning"}]," — cooler, and the light is good. Leave after Fajr and you are back before the midday heat."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Avoid the Hajj period"}],", when the sites are restricted and in use."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Fridays"}]," — plan around the midday prayer."]}],"\n"]}]
